For a coordinate value `v`, the adjacent values should be `v-1`, `v`, and `v+1`. So the range should be `range(v-1, v+2)` which gives `[v-1, v, v+1]`.

The current code has `range(ele[0] - 1, ele[0 + 1] + 2)` which is `range(v-1, v+3)`, giving `[v-1, v, v+1, v+2]` — one extra value.

